cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the accompanying paper below."
type: software
title: "SAP.py2.0"
abstract: >
  A Python-based tool that interfaces with SAP2000 via its OAPI/comtypes
  COM layer to automate combinatorial generation of structural damage
  scenarios, producing labeled modal-analysis datasets for downstream
  ML/AI training in structural health monitoring (SHM) research. Dataset
  generation is deliberately decoupled from any optimization or
  model-updating loop.
